1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,480
Main Road
Country of Zhao

25
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,400
Liu San
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

26
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,480
We made it through safely

27
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:00,470
thanks to you, Chief.

28
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:01,640
Yang Sen
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

29
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,590
Chief,

30
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:07,430
we are escorting a valuable shipment this time.

31
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:10,070
We should be getting a 10% cut, right ?

32
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:10,600
Du Feng
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

33
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,560
The Boss has always been fair

34
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,310
as long as we complete the delivery.

35
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:17,190
We’re only 4 days away from Tianshui City now.

36
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,150
Stay focused !

37
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,230
Got it !

38
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,550
Yang Sen, go check it out.

39
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:29,920
Okay.

40
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,320
Young man, you’ve got guts.

41
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:43,760
I’m Yang Sen from the Wei Wu Mercenary Agency.

42
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:46,040
Why are you walking the Main Road alone ?

43
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,520
Do you need help ?

44
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,880
My name is Wang Lin,

45
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,070
I'm a woodcarver.

46
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,560
I’m heading to Tianshui City to make a living

47
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,470
but I’m lost.

48
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,280
Could you tell me how to get to Tianshui City ?

49
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,870
What a coincidence, we’re also going to Tianshui City.

50
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,640
You can come with us.

51
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,150
Thank you very much.

52
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,110
Senior,

53
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:39,070
I finished inscribing this jade tablet as you taught me.

54
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,870
Good. After refining it,

55
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,190
this jade talisman has become a Core Formation artifact.

56
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:44,990
A Core Formation artifact ?

57
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,910
Yes, a Core Formation artifact,

58
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:50,800
an artifact with the power of a Core Formation cultivator.

59
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,950
That Sun Dazhu was such a fool,

60
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:56,320
he had good artifacts but didn't know how to refine them.

61
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,350
If not for my knowledge,

62
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,870
these artifacts would have been wasted.

63
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,310
Senior,

64
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,000
I'm already at the peak of Qi Condensation.

65
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,190
If I go to Tianshui City

66
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,150
and find some wood element materials

67
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,920
to upgrade the Heaven Defying Bead,

68
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,480
will I be able to reach Foundation Establishment ?

69
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,430
Not yet.

70
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,080
How long will it take ?

71
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,270
How long ?

72
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:20,630
You blockhead !

73
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,710
If you think this method is too slow,

74
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:23,920
then listen to me

75
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,400
and steal a Foundation.

76
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,480
Senior...

77
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:30,080
I don't think I can capture a Foundation Establishment cultivator alive.

78
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,000
And even if I did,

79
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,550
that person would die without a doubt.

80
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,840
Foundation Stealing

81
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,630
is a bit too cruel for me.

82
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,870
It's the law of the jungle,

83
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,320
harming others for your own benefit is natural !

84
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,080
With your mindset,

85
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,080
you’ll suffer sooner or later.

86
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,790
Brother Wang arrived at the right time.

87
00:04:53,810 --> 00:04:56,520
Today is the day Mister Li is reading our fortunes.

88
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,280
Mister Li
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

89
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,070
You’re really lucky,

90
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,070
Mister Li is a living Immortal.

91
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,830
Fine,

92
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,870
I’ll read your fortunes today.

93
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,600
Thank you, sir.

94
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,710
Dark clouds loom over you,

95
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,110
you will be part of a bloodshed.

96
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,840
This calamity is imminent,

97
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,280
but if you can survive it

98
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:27,560
you’ll have a romantic encounter within 3 months.

99
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:31,270
As a mercenary, I'm always in danger.

100
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,750
Being in bloodsheds

101
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,830
is inevitable.

102
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,680
Weird...

103
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,630
Why are you also part of a bloodshed ?

104
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:44,600
Old Liu, you too have bloodshed in your fortune !

105
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:48,830
This...

106
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,670
This...

107
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,750
Everyone here has signs of a bloodshed.

108
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,470
This doesn’t look good !

109
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,680
You...

110
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,600
Senior...

111
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,560
Mister, does he also have a bloodshed in his fortune ?

112
00:06:09,610 --> 00:06:11,440
It has nothing to do with this young man

113
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:13,870
but my fortune-telling skills might be lacking...

114
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,960
I can’t see through him.

115
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,240
I can’t see through him.

116
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,870
This Junior's fortune-telling is interesting.

117
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,670
I sent him memories of me killing people.

118
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,670
Who is here !?

119
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,470
Show your face at once !

120
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,910
Mister Liu San,

121
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,750
hand over the ginseng

122
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,550
and we won't hurt anyone !

123
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,480
Song Xing
Mortal

124
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,270
Song Xing, you are pathetic.

125
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,240
Let’s see who won’t leave alive !

126
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,110
Immortal... an Immortal spell !

127
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,600
Hand over the ginseng,

128
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,710
or you will die.

129
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,390
Zhang Hu ?

130
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,750
Old Liu, just hand it over.

131
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,110
How can mortals like us resist an Immortal ?

132
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:21,910
The boss won’t blame us.

133
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:28,910
Bold of you !

134
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,060
You...

135
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,470
You’re actually an Immortal !

136
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,640
You're meeting an old friend

137
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,040
yet you won’t you come out and greet me ?

138
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,350
Greetings, Boss !

139
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,000
Who are you ?

140
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,390
Hand over the ginseng if you know what’s good for you.

141
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,760
Otherwise,

142
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,720
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

143
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,720
Something's wrong...

144
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,440
My bad,

145
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,480
I mistook you for someone else.

146
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,280
You’re a smart one.

147
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:23,400
Now get lost !

148
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,110
Greetings, Immortal !

149
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,440
Bai Zhan
Rogue cultivator
15th layer of Qi Condensation

150
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,510
Master.

151
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:59,430
Immortal, please spare us.

152
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,830
He's at the peak of Qi Condensation.

153
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,750
The same level as you.

154
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,160
Perfect,

155
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:05,990
Little Lin,

156
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,150
it's a good opportunity to try out your new artifacts.

157
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,950
Zhang Hu,

158
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,070
why don't you greet

159
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,590
this old friend of yours.

160
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,070
Master,

161
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,440
disciple doesn’t know this person.

162
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,950
Good.

163
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:34,190
8th layer of Qi Condensation...

164
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:35,790
If I can drink his blood

165
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:38,830
it will surely boost my cultivation.

166
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,150
I’ll help you, Master.

167
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,070
Master...

168
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,270
Did you think

169
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,390
I didn't see that speed talisman !?

170
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,350
Master !

171
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,520
This person is a friend of mine.

172
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,350
Please...

173
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,990
please spare him !

174
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:10,150
So you were trying to help him escape ?

175
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,670
You overestimate yourself.

176
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,630
This guy

177
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:18,150
probably used a control poison on Zhang Hu.

178
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,710
You’re not at the 8th layer !

179
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,200
Even if you're Foundation Establishment,

180
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:58,510
you won’t escape this flying sword !

181
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,040
Such a fast sword !

182
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,280
This flying sword is strange.

183
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:11,070
Little Lin, be careful !

184
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,830
This... this is a Core Formation artifact !

185
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,990
I am Old Man Ji Mo's disciple !

186
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,800
This kind of life or death battle

187
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,830
is perfect to temper you.

188
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,830
Only then

189
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:14,830
can you see the true nature of the cultivation world.

190
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,990
He’s dead...

191
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,880
Was it because of him

192
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,000
that you didn't acknowledge me earlier ?

193
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,800
He’s really dead !

194
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,910
Wang Lin,

195
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,270
this isn’t the place to talk.

196
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,510
We can catch up

197
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,840
after we dispose of them.

198
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,670
Dead persons won't talk !

199
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:52,200
Bai Zhan is Old Man Ji Mo's disciple,

200
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,960
he'll investigate this matter !

201
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,030
If he does,

202
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,960
we won't be able to escape death !

203
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,760
Exalted Immortals,

204
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,150
we swear we won’t say a word.

205
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,040
You won't ?

206
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,560
But if someone extracts your soul and refines it,

207
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:10,150
they will know everything.

208
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,110
I erased their memories of tonight.

209
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,230
Let’s go.

210
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,320
It’s been many years

211
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:37,830
since we parted at Heng Yue Sect.

212
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,920
After you left the Heng Yue Sect,

213
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:45,640
I had no one else to drink with.

214
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,920
Same here...

215
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,550
I need to find a safe place

216
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:56,270
to refine this flying sword into my artifact.

217
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,320
If we need to fight,

218
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,200
it will increase our chances.

219
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,430
Perfect.

220
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,190
I was planning to lay low in the nearby Teng Family City.

221
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,270
Let’s go together.

222
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:07,950
Otherwise, who knows when we’ll meet again ?

223
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,920
Teng Family City ?

224
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:12,680
The Teng Family is a cultivation family

225
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,520
with a Nascent Soul Ancestor.

226
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,640
No one in Zhao dares to provoke them.

227
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,130
Fighting is forbidden inside the city.

228
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,310
Outsiders can enter by paying a few spirit stones

229
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,510
and settle here.

230
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:23,470
Even Old Man Ji Mo

231
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:26,670
wouldn't dare to cause a ruckus here.

232
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,070
Foundation Establishment...

233
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,900
Stay away,

234
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,600
he's from the Corpse Sect.

235
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,160
The Corpse Sect ?

236
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,070
The Corpse Sect is present everywhere.

237
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,350
Every cultivation country,

238
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,470
has one branch of it.

239
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,670
Come in.

240
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,920
The coffin contains a Corpse Puppet,

241
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,230
a puppet refined from a corpse.

242
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,800
It's the secret technique of their sect.

243
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,920
The higher the disciple’s cultivation,

244
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,320
the stronger the Corpse Puppet.

245
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,270
Please come in.

246
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,390
What brings you here this time ?

247
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,990
Stay away from them in the future,

248
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,950
the Corpse Sect is evil.

249
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,390
Fellow cultivator, come take a look !

250
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:26,000
Inn
Teng Family City

251
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,320
It's trying to escape !?

252
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,520
Artifacts with a spirit

253
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:07,040
really are different.

254
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,240
Senior,

255
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:12,430
is there a way for me to refine it quickly ?

256
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,590
I have a method

257
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,190
but you won't dare to use it.

258
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,070
Why ?

259
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,550
It’s called Blood Refining.

260
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,560
You need to use your Soul Blood to refine it.

261
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:26,190
The upside is that the sword will be yours instantly.

262
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,440
The downside however...

263
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:31,550
is that if the sword is damaged, you also will be.

264
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:36,470
The backlash will be far worse than with regular methods.

265
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,550
I’ll do it.

266
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:38,830
Please teach me, Senior.

267
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:39,920
Oh ?

268
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,840
You’re quite ruthless on yourself.

269
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,600
If you used this ruthlessness on others,

270
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:46,480
you'd already be Foundation Establishment.

271
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,230
Wang Lin,

272
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,200
are you sure you won’t come with me to sell the ginseng ?

273
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,070
I’m busy,

274
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,510
go without me.

275
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:02,120
Residence of the Ancestor
Teng Family City

276
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:05,390
This is a small token of my respect.

277
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,720
I hope Ancestor Teng will help me.

278
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,560
Old Man Ji Mo
Rogue cultivator
Early stage Core Formation

279
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,000
That's good stuff.

280
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:15,550
But I am the one who forbade fighting inside the city.

281
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,920
This puts me in a difficult position.

282
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,030
But...

283
00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:20,110
this...

284
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,760
Teng Huayuan
Teng Family Ancestor
Early stage Nascent Soul

285
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,720
Teng Li
Young Master of The Teng Family
Late stage Foundation Establishment

286
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,630
Forgive me.

287
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:28,550
This is my grandson, Teng Li.

288
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,430
Li'er pays respects to Grandfather.

289
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,710
Well done.

290
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,430
I present to you Old Man Ji Mo,

291
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:47,190
he's here today to ask for our help.

292
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,360
This Nascent Soul artifact

293
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:53,430
isn't meant for a Foundation Establishment...

294
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,280
What are you implying ?

295
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:58,560
That I, Teng Li, am unworthy of this Nascent Soul artifact ?

296
00:17:58,760 --> 00:17:59,150
Hmph !

297
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:01,350
Then let me show you.

298
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,750
Look, what’s that ?

299
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:30,790
The clouds have been torn open !

300
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,470
Young Master, please avenge my disciple.

301
00:18:50,280 --> 00:20:52,120
The Soul Blood is the most important part of a cultivator's soul. Destroying someone's Soul Blood instantly collapses that person's soul. Unless it is willingly given to someone, cultivators will always keep it safely inside their soul. This is why using it in blood refining is dangerous and has consequences if the blood refined artifact is damaged or destroyed.

Artifacts can house a spirit, making them sentient. In the case of a sword, the spirit will be referred to as a Sword Spirit. That's the case of Wang Lin's new sword.

A rogue cultivator is a cultivator without a sect (Wang Lin is a rogue since he lost his sect).

Spirit stones are the money used by cultivators. They're basically a crystalized form of spiritual energy that is naturally formed in areas dense in spiritual energy known as Spirit Veins. The energy from a spirit stone can thus be absorbed to heal, to cultivate, to power a formation, etc... There are grades of spirit stones depending on the density of spiritual energy inside it.

'er at the end of a name is the equivalent of an affective nickname. Here Teng Li refers to himself as "Li'er" when talking to Teng Huayuan because his grandfather calls him "Li'er".

302
00:18:55,800 --> 00:19:01,440
I've been walking this path for endless years

303
00:18:58,450 --> 00:19:01,440
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

304
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:07,040
Is it the compass of fate

305
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:07,040
that wrote this outcome for us ?

306
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:12,960
The heavens want to erase your existence,

307
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:18,680
that's the obsession guiding me.

308
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:24,280
Is this the path to uncover

309
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:24,280
truths from falsehoods ?

310
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:29,880
In a world of murk and shadow,

311
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:29,880
only the flame of truth can light the way.

312
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:35,600
Look at them all,

313
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:35,600
being carried by the waves.

314
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:40,240
Look at them all,

315
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:40,240
being drowned.

316
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:43,560
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

317
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:46,640
I will let the world refine my soul.

318
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:52,200
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

319
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:52,200
I will fight.

320
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:55,320
I'll break through the abyss of despair

321
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:58,360
to finally learn who I really am.

322
00:19:58,360 --> 00:20:03,720
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

323
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:03,720
I embrace this obsession.

324
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:06,680
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

325
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,480
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

326
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:14,960
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

327
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:14,960
I'll still fight.

328
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:18,320
It's hard to avoid loneliness

329
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:21,360
when you are above everyone else.

330
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:27,040
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

331
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:27,040
be afraid of a firefly ?
